105 Minutes of Knocking — a Sports Telestrator film (fictional show "Chalk Talk")

An unofficial analysis of the 2026 World Cup final. Not made or endorsed by FIFA, the national federations, the players or any broadcaster.
No match footage, photos or broadcast audio are used: the pitch, players, ball and crowd sound are drawn and synthesized in code,
as a reconstruction from published match reports (positions illustrative). Facts and sources: FACTS.md.

